<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[Hi&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},<div><br></div><div>Congratulations on your admission to ASU! The College of Health Solutions is here to help with your next steps. We are excited that you are considering ASU, but understand that you may be feeling <b>anxious</b> about transferring, <b>unsure</b> of what your next step is, and <b>worried</b> about how to get financial aid and register for classes. By completing the Blackboard course "<b>College of Health Solutions Online Orientation</b>," all of these questions and many more will be answered for you. To find this course, please follow these steps:</div><div><br></div><div>1. Go to <a href="my.asu.edu">my.asu.edu</a> and log in using your ASURITE User ID and password.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>2. Select the <b>Blackboard</b> link at the bottom of the <b>My Classes</b> section.</div><div><br></div><div><img src="https://asu--c.na14.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015d000000CT0Bv&amp;oid=00Dd0000000hLoc" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>3. In the top left corner, select the <b>Courses</b> tab.</div><div><img src="https://asu--c.na14.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015d000000CT0DI&amp;oid=00Dd0000000hLoc" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>4. On the left-hand column, you will find a <b>Course Search</b> area. Search for and select <b>College of Health Solutions Online Orientation</b>.</div><div><img src="https://asu--c.na14.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015d000000CT0DS&amp;oid=00Dd0000000hLoc" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>5. Find and click <b>Enroll</b> under the drop-down arrow below <b>Course ID</b> to sign yourself up for the course. Next, press the red <b>Submit</b> button followed by the <b>OK</b> button on the bottom of the right side of the page.</div><div><img src="https://asu--c.na14.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015d000000CT0DN&amp;oid=00Dd0000000hLoc" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>This Blackboard course was created for you to refer to throughout your academic career at ASU. Specific tabs in this course can help you find where to park on campus, purchase football tickets, locate academic advising and more.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>To get started, click each heading on the left side of the page, read all the content offered and then complete the quiz. After completing the quiz, call our academic advising office to make your advising appointment. The front desk will check to make sure you've completed the quiz before you meet your academic advisor.</div><div><br></div><div>You are now on your way to becoming a Sun Devil! Please let us know if you have any questions on your next steps. Welcome to the ASU family.</div><div><br></div><div>Sincerely,</div><div><br></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">College of Health Solutions Recruitment Team</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Arizona State University</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">602-496-0207</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="mailto:chs@asu.edu">chs@asu.edu</a></span></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>